<%- include('partials/header') %>
<h1>Offices</h1>
<p class="lede">Each person belongs to one office. People, profiles, discussions, the daily question and newsletters are shared by everyone. Parts, stock, trucks, tasks, training, certifications, announcements and complaints stay inside each office.</p>
<%- include('partials/errors') %>
<ul class="records">
  <% rows.forEach(function (b) { %>
  <li class="card">
    <div class="rec-head"><strong><%= b.name %></strong><time><%= b.people %> <%= b.people === 1 ? 'person' : 'people' %><%= b.off ? ', ' + b.off + ' without sign-in' : '' %></time></div>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/branches/<%= b.id %>" class="filters">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <label class="grow"><span class="sr">Name</span><input name="name" value="<%= b.name %>" maxlength="60" required autocomplete="off"></label>
      <div class="filter-actions"><button class="btn small" type="submit">Rename</button><a class="btn small" href="/people?branch=<%= b.id %>">See its people</a></div>
    </form>
  </li>
  <% }) %>
</ul>
<h2>Add a office</h2>
<form method="post" action="/admin/branches" class="card stack">
  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
  <label>Name <span class="hint">Usually the town, for example Harrisburg.</span><input name="name" value="<%= values.name || '' %>" maxlength="60" required autocomplete="off"></label>
  <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Add office</button>
</form>
<div class="notice">
  <p><strong>Who sees what</strong></p>
  <p>You can see every office. Use the office box in the menu to choose which one the logs, stock and other pages show, or "All offices" to see them together.</p>
  <p>Everyone else sees only their own office, whatever their profile. To let someone else see every office, tick "See and manage every office" on their profile.</p>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
